  "description": "A standalone software raster Canvas for PeachDrawing.Core - draw shapes, text and images onto a bitmap and save it in any PeachImage-supported format, with no PDF, HTML or CSS involved. This is also the raster fallback PeachPDF itself uses for effects PDF cannot express in vector form (filters, shadows, backdrop effects).",
